Subject: [PATCH] mmc: sunxi: support T113 PF voltage switching and SD tuning

Let boards with separate 1.8 V and 3.3 V sources expose the D1 PF
selector as the MMC signal supply. Use the register sequence from
the Allwinner BSP without panicking on an unsuccessful transition.

Set the SMHC voltage-switch bit for CMD11 and tune the sample delay
for UHS-I. Retry at lower clocks when no stable window is found.

